ore_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-10-04, when Dave asked what he works on to relax, Calvin shared a photo of a shiny orange car with its hood open and said he loves working on this project \"to chill out\" (a car project Calvin is working on himself — distinct from his own Ferrari, see ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26); makes sense given his long-standing finding that working on/fixing cars relaxes him \"like meditation,\" see the 2023-05-31 entry in ## Relationships) [S21T3].\n- On 2023-10-15, when Dave (feeling discouraged after his shop lost a deal to a competitor) asked how he stays motivated when faced with setbacks: \"When setbacks come my way, I remind myself why I'm passionate about my goals. I rely on helpful people around me and take a break to recharge with my favorite activities. That always helps me get back to feeling motivated.\" (complements his earlier 2023-07-21 answer about staying motivated, see above) [S23T3][S23T4].\n- On 2023-10-15, said performing with Frank Ocean \"recently has been really cool\" — said while reacting to Dave's music-festival story (see ## Relationships); the Frank Ocean tour he described to Dave on 2023-08-14 as having ended with the Tokyo show predates this remark, which suggests more recent performing with Frank Ocean (details in ## Frank Ocean collaboration; confirmed on 2023-10-19, when he told Dave he has started touring with Frank Ocean — see ## Frank Ocean collaboration) [S23T10].\n- On 2023-10-23, on the balance and pressure of touring/fame (complementing his earlier motivation answers, see above): the tour is incredible and energizing, but fame has its own challenges — balancing it all has been tough; he takes it one day at a time, it can get overwhelming with so many demands, but he enjoys what he does so he pushes on; a strong support system is a key strategy — his friends and team keep him on track [S25T2][S25T4][S25T6].\n- On 2023-10-23, when Dave asked (after Dave shared his good conversation with neighbors about current events and politics) how he stays informed and inspired: staying connected and up-to-date on world events is important to him — it helps his music stand out by incorporating unique perspectives, connects him better with his fans, and keeps him motivated and inspired [S25T8].","text_sha256":"18efab7aa0e4325cff5b08095bcef6b5967d495bbd419c5ca77c1bf66ffeb2d4","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D3:9"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":72,"line_start":72,"source_locators":["[S3T9]"],"text_sha256":"a9b417535342c0ed28b7099abc42ad1d3cd093fe62088f223c600f3e73923a4f"},{"dia_ids":["D3:14","D3:15"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":73,"line_start":73,"source_locators":["[S3T14]","[S3T15]"],"text_sha256":"485aaa6c75c245515c473b6a62a732ad0b23b86b3a47f044eedf4b91b34da20d"},{"dia_ids":["D3:15"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":74,"line_start":74,"source_locators":["[S3T15]"],"text_sha256":"6250376aa5b7304401a720bf48260af95b560f1abefb4dd4e7e89ce4f3a99246"},{"dia_ids":["D3:10","D3:15","D3:16"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":75,"line_start":75,"source_locators":["[S3T10]","[S3T15]","[S3T16]"],"text_sha256":"73a45f933148d30fc73820c1700b1ed471aa4285625d0e090da10916d452083c"},{"dia_ids":["D3:17"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":76,"line_start":76,"source_locators":["[S3T17]"],"text_sha256":"04eb8dd2330bb493e49250a9aae8136633e16a445c9ee3523b626a6cfe59fe17"},{"dia_ids":["D7:15","D7:16"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":77,"line_start":77,"source_locators":["[S7T15]","[S7T16]"],"text_sha256":"dca3a057098de2813b92dfaf529c6044403d79d52bde4c4cd32fcde70b514a86"},{"dia_ids":["D8:5","D8:7"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":78,"line_start":78,"source_locators":["[S8T5]","[S8T7]"],"text_sha256":"78c687ab267ed7fd97ac36cdf72d50878299d5a7a6ced9c939d542d5241b17df"},{"dia_ids":["D15:10","D15:11"],"kind":"