id":"session_18","session_index":18,"source_sha256":"18dcdeb48e1e44016740fe25592e3d6791f15c8a882a9371b6ec2d7a8aa7dcd1","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":11},{"dia_id":"D18:12","global_turn_index":318,"locator":"[S18T12]","raw_turn_sha256":"2d83bdd599cdb2ebce4a625db0467922390c17f8cc27a6ef48044331ccd03a04","rendered_turn_sha256":"d47875895b1fa0ff3bacc17ad13103484b62eef25a6185e48ab73fa04363de5b","session_date":"2023-09-13","session_datetime":"2023-09-13T10:56:00","session_id":"session_18","session_index":18,"source_sha256":"cca55b8e4f753aff45a5102a919ac858b18dd1735f4afee1131120dd605c3cd4","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":12}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- Plans to make a trip to Boston after he finishes the Frank Ocean tour; has heard the music scene there is awesome and is excited to check it out [S3T9].\n- Not yet seen Boston apart from gigs — he has been busy with rehearsals and traveling [S3T14][S3T15].\n- Looking forward to exploring the city, trying out delicious food, and visiting popular attractions [S3T15].\n- Dave (apparently Boston-based) is offering to show him around — including Paradise Rock, House of Blues, and Fenway Park — and to take him to his favorite food spots; Calvin proposed grabbing a bite together when he is in Boston, and Dave agreed [S3T10][S3T15][S3T16] (see /memories/dave.md > ## Boston).\n- Calvin is looking forward to trying the food in Boston with Dave and called it fun (\"Can't wait to try out the food there with you\") [S3T17].\n- As of 2023-05-31, the Boston visit is part of the Frank Ocean tour: \"Cool, can't wait for the tour with Frank!\" — he's \"buzzing to perform in Boston and see what it's like\" and \"Gonna be great playing for folks from home\" (calling Boston's folks \"from home\" suggests it is where he's from, though not stated outright). He asked Dave what he thinks of the music scene there; Dave: it's \"awesome — Tons of talented musicians and cool places to play,\" and he'll be there to cheer Calvin on (details in /memories/dave.md > ## Boston) [S7T15][S7T16].\n- On 2023-06-09, said he has never been to Boston before but has heard the parks are amazing — \"can't wait to visit next month\" (i.e., July 2023); he wants to take walks in the Boston parks to experience their serenity and recharge, and asked Dave what cool things he remembers about them; shared a photo of a tree with pink flowers (likely from the album session); Dave's recollections of the Boston parks are in /memories/dave.md > ## Boston [S8T5][S8T7].\n- As of 2023-08-22, said his tour ends soon and he's heading to Boston, and proposed meeting up with Dave then — \"Maybe we can meet up then!\" (renewing the earlier plan to meet in Boston, see above); Dave: \"Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\" (Note: the 2023-08-14 update described the Frank Ocean tour as already having ended with the Tokyo show, so this \"tour ends soon\" may be a continuation or a new tour — unconfirmed) [S15T10][S15T11].\n- On 2023-09-02, told Dave he booked a flight to Boston \"last week\" (~2023-08-26 through 09-01) and is \"so excited\" about the upcoming Boston trip, sharing a photo of a book with a boarding pass on it — \"See you soon, buddy!\"; he'll let Dave know when he's in Boston, and Dave told him to let him know when he's free so they can catch up in Boston (continuing the plan to meet up in Boston, see above) [S17T6][S17T7][S17T8]. The chat closed with Dave: \"Looking forward to seeing you! Have a safe trip, see ya!\"; Calvin thanked Dave, reciprocated the safe-trip wishes (\"Gotta stay safe on the trip\"), said \"Can't wait to see you there!\", and promised he will contact Dave when he arrives [S17T9][S17T10].\n- On 2023-09-13, re-pledged the plan to let Dave know when he's in Boston — \"I'll let you know when I'm in Boston\" — and accepted Dave's offer to check out his garage and its cool cars (Dave shared a photo of the garage — a car in a garage with a Coca-Cola sign — \"looks stunning!\"), saying it would be fun and might give him ideas for future projects (details in ## Relationships; Dave's side in /memories/dave.md > ## Boston) [S18T11][S18T12].","text_sha256":"e25684b374ea895401ac741e3a900dac968245c7db4f58b80a9e40b9b6f0ca19","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D14:4","D14:6"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":58,"line_start":58,"source_locators":["[S14T4]","[S14T6]"],"text_sha256":"ddf26b2376de4e3b7f7f49b7beb47b3b3c17f70ef24acbcce3636808ef9d4866"},{"dia_ids":["D16:2","D16:3","D16:4"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":59,"line_start":59,"source_locators":["[S16T2]","[S16T3]","[S16T4]"],"text_sha256":"a3efd2d706aa2c9470749bd84340146a439afdb61fcbc3fb47cf71a68fb4d6e7"},{"dia_ids":["D24:1","D24:3"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":60,"line_start":60,"source_locators":["[S24T1]","[S24T3]"],"text_sha256":"3c876d987136749ba1542215b9c9a1014c3530a626416e793f3416cc6625f0c5"},{"dia_ids":["D24:9","D24:10","D24:11"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":61,"line_start":61,"source_locators":["[S24T9]","[S24T10]","[S24T11]"],"text_sha256":"8e7bdf92071b1e13552604f10b2a90728cc1dcab8fe69506f319455b267cc63e"},{"dia_ids":["D24:17","D24:19","D24:21"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":62,"line_start":62,"source_locators":["[S24T17]","[S24T19]","[S24T21]"],"text_sha256":"6686fa291778dd7977795f1853fb37fbb2b01671335f3975ae71ab7a4075b241"}],"dia_ids":["D14:4","D14:6","D16:2","D16:3","D16:4","D24:1","D24:3","D24:9","D24:10","D24:11","D24:17","D24:19","D24:21"],"evidence_id":"ev-207bdaae23e4b89c1daebfb4340bbafff61e2a3a32ce2ff83104fe731fc2eabe","group_id":"/memories/calvin.md > # Calvin","line_end":62,"line_start":58,"observation_ids":["obs-0001"],"path":"/memories/calvin.md","query_terms":["calvin","frank","ocean","tour"],"rank":5,"re