n_id":"session_24","session_index":24,"source_sha256":"f64dace341ba6f80079b0138e9da7192a9e3c974478d1a2f492b4b74847c0917","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":19},{"dia_id":"D24:21","global_turn_index":422,"locator":"[S24T21]","raw_turn_sha256":"674d0c1eedcb3bdccc60a6148306d228a8225499360986dc06f5431f4e70a0f7","rendered_turn_sha256":"ef984ac1b9d79f54dceed1fb4a3225446a1ecae650cd6a9791443dedac9fd795","session_date":"2023-10-19","session_datetime":"2023-10-19T10:11:00","session_id":"session_24","session_index":24,"source_sha256":"536f4d60768c824e4fa5f6c0551f153b46908d30a33d0974956d945f5b01ffb0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":21}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-08-14, updated Dave that the tour with the well-known artist (the Frank Ocean tour, see above) ended with a show in Japan — the Tokyo show was \"awesome\": everyone was \"so into it\" when he played one of his songs and sang along, which he called \"a magical moment\"; feeling of performing and connecting with the audience \"was unreal\"; after the tour he had the opportunity to explore his new place (the Japanese mansion, see ## New home (2023-03-23)) — \"it's like a dream come true!\" [S14T4][S14T6].\n- On 2023-08-31, when Dave asked how the end of the tour was, Calvin said the tour was amazing — he was \"so pumped from all the energy from the audience\" — and shared a photo of a crowd watching a concert with a large screen (\"This pic totally captures how I felt. Such an amazing time!\"); when Dave asked how it was performing on that big stage, Calvin said it was \"a dream come true\" — the energy was incredible, he \"felt on top of the world\", and it was \"seriously surreal\" [S16T2][S16T3][S16T4].\n- On 2023-10-19, told Dave he has started touring with Frank Ocean (\"lots happened\" since they last talked) — \"it's been amazing\": so much energy from the crowd and \"such a connection when I'm on stage — unreal!\"; the tour \"has been great\" and \"jamming with Frank Ocean is a dream come true\" (another Frank Ocean tour after the earlier ones listed here — Dave is looking forward to attending one of its shows, see the 2023-10-19 entry in ## Relationships) [S24T1][S24T3].\n- On 2023-10-19, shared another photo of the tour crowd: a crowd of people at a concert with their hands in the air — \"Wow, the crowd energy is amazing! It always gets me so pumped and it's awesome. Look at that photo, that was awesome!\"; when Dave asked where it was taken, Calvin said it was taken in Tokyo during a concert — \"the energy was nuts - felt like the whole city came out!\" (Dave's enthusiasm about visiting Tokyo, see /memories/dave.md > ## Japan) [S24T9][S24T10][S24T11].\n- On 2023-10-19, announced he's actually going to Tokyo in November 2023 (\"next month\") after the tour ends — shared a photo of a city at night with a tall building in the background (\"What a great view!\") and said \"Sometimes I wish I could go back to places like [that]\"; spots he's excited to check out: Shibuya Crossing — \"like Tokyo's Times Square\" — and Shinjuku; he can't wait to try the amazing food there again (shared a photo of Shibuya Crossing at night — a crowd of people with umbrellas in the rain); he has never tried ramen but \"it's supposed to be awesome\" — \"Gonna give it a shot while in Tokyo!\" — after Dave (who tried ramen in Boston) encouraged him (Dave's side in /memories/dave.md > ## Japan) [S24T17][S24T19][S24T21].","text_sha256":"717862b2f9ea47a486e3644ec2a938b6203e2085a3189a0cf1245fa111f0a892","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":637,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":18081,"provider_request_attempts":4,"pro